 "notes": [
  "All top-level rects are absolute source pixels; every rect inside 'parts' is relative to its template origin.",
  "Text 'size' is cap-height x 1.4 (cap recorded too) so the real font can be calibrated against the reference.",
  "Tabs: both frames are 368 px wide, so active/inactive swap without scaling. The active frame is 78 tall at y 284 (with its bottom ornament); the inactive one 68 tall at y 288.",
  "attack/tab_revenge keeps the baked REVENGE label and an emptied badge circle; draw the count text over it. tab_active_frame has label and badge removed (for TARGETS-active). No badge-less variant of the labelled revenge tab exists: with zero revenge available render '0' or use tab_active_frame + label.",
  "Target card frame has name/level/power/amount/your+their numbers AND the button area removed, so either btn_attack_green or shield_pill can sit there. Portrait and crest regions are kept baked (Seraphine/lion) and are always fully covered by a 136x136 portrait and a 91x120 crest at the same offsets.",
  "Power bar is assembled from five pieces: bar_left (green cap), bar_green (stretch), bar_split (green->red seam), bar_red (stretch), bar_right (red cap). Total width 468, height 26.",
  "Header crop includes the painting behind the tabs (y 284..366) with this screen's own currency pills inpainted; the shared chrome pills draw over it at the chrome positions.",
  "The shield notice text is baked in attack/notice_bar ('30-minute'); attack/notice_bar_blank has the sentence removed for a server-driven duration.",
  "Reference cards are 225/213/206 px tall (each generated slightly differently); the template is card 1 (228 incl. 3 px of ground) with pitch 229, which puts card 2 exactly at its reference y and card 3 11 px lower than the reference."
 ],
